OL,3,GNEWSABlind voter says voting privacy
OL,4,Adenied
OL,5,
OL,6,FCurrent election rules deny blind
OL,7,Fpeople the right to cast a secret
OL,8,Fballot independently, a blind member of
OL,9,Fan electoral authority says.
OL,11,FJohannes Martinson, of the Jersey
OL,12,FElectoral Authority, visited 14 of the
OL,13,Fisland's 19 polling stations during
OL,14,FJune's election to assess
OL,15,Faccessibility, after no budget was made
OL,16,Favailable for a survey into barriers
OL,17,Ffacing voters.
OL,19,FHe said despite efforts to improve
OL,20,Fphysical access, blind voters were
OL,21,Fstill unable to mark their own ballot
OL,22,Fpapers independently.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
